{"2518490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dataminers", "steam_appid": 2518490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5174670], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dataminers is a turn-based logic-adventure in which you crack data towers of evil corporations. Use numbers to locate the datamines around you and hack them to clear a path. The tower is well guarded! Be careful not to set off the alarm and every move counts! Reach the top of the tower and hack their mainframe before the firewall catches up on you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself in a variety of game modes with a ton of difficulty settings, level progression and unlockables. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518490/extras/d8c62fd64257158dc3adc7e0bafec63a.avif?t=1788277868\" width=798 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete procedurally generated missions within strategic campaigns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge paths through increasingly complex and challenging enemy infrastructures as you evade their security with puzzle-solving skills, mental agility and a tonne of varied items and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518490/extras/8934faf92a3f9190db65f619de954882.avif?t=1788277868\" width=798 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock to defuse all mines and beat your personal best times. One wrong move and it's all over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518490/extras/0c290169687c2bbaa326dbfd53bb8c3d.avif?t=1788277868\" width=798 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your endurance and immerse yourself in worlds inspired by iconic science fiction movies. How long can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518490/extras/e48c9334874511599a5a9de36be1c58b.avif?t=1788277868\" width=798 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind as you play in tranquil environments where mistakes have no consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ever played Minesweeper?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No?</strong> Don't worry, you'll learn all the gameplay mechanics in our safeguarded Training Center and be ready to climb in no time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yes?</strong> You're already ahead of the game, but with campaign missions, enemy defences, unlockable items and more, Dataminers takes Minesweeper beyond the desktop!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dataminers is a turn-based logic-adventure in which you crack data towers of evil corporations. Use numbers to locate the datamines around you and hack them to clear a path. The tower is well guarded! Be careful not to set off the alarm and every move counts! Reach the top of the tower and hack their mainframe before the firewall catches up on you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself in a variety of game modes with a ton of difficulty settings, level progression and unlockables. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518490/extras/d8c62fd64257158dc3adc7e0bafec63a.avif?t=1788277868\" width=798 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete procedurally generated missions within strategic campaigns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge paths through increasingly complex and challenging enemy infrastructures as you evade their security with puzzle-solving skills, mental agility and a tonne of varied items and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518490/extras/8934faf92a3f9190db65f619de954882.avif?t=1788277868\" width=798 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock to defuse all mines and beat your personal best times. One wrong move and it's all over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518490/extras/0c290169687c2bbaa326dbfd53bb8c3d.avif?t=1788277868\" width=798 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your endurance and immerse yourself in worlds inspired by iconic science fiction movies. How long can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518490/extras/e48c9334874511599a5a9de36be1c58b.avif?t=1788277868\" width=798 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind as you play in tranquil environments where mistakes have no consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ever played Minesweeper?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No?</strong> Don't worry, you'll learn all the gameplay mechanics in our safeguarded Training Center and be ready to climb in no time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yes?</strong> You're already ahead of the game, but with campaign missions, enemy defences, unlockable items and more, Dataminers takes Minesweeper beyond the desktop!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Get inside the mind of an ethical hacker and race against the firewall as you collect data, hack terminals and bring enemies down from the inside. Dataminers is a casual logic game, where you climb and clear towers full of data mines.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518490/686dc92d902848019c46d00e6539c9a0fb686f0e/header.jpg?t=1788277868", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518490/fbc63c372871c44f36b4fea056773bb2fe6c04c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788277868", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518490/fbc63c372871c44f36b4fea056773bb2fe6c04c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788277868", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 700 series or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mojave 10.14+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon, x64 architecture with SSE2.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal capable Intel and AMD GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04, Ubuntu 18.04, and CentOS 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support.<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.2+ or Vulkan capable</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Electrocosmos"], "publishers": ["Application Systems Heidelberg"], "demos": [{"appid": 4064820, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": true, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 64, "description": "Adjustable Text Size"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 78, "description": "Adjustable Difficulty"}, {"id": 76, "description": "Mouse Only Option"}, {"id": 80, "description": "#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 25, "description": "Steam Leaderboards"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "2", "description": "Strategy"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.s